# Build context for the shared derived-image recipe.
#
# harness/derived-image/Dockerfile takes the repository root as its context but
# copies only the attempt payload under src/ and its own helpers under harness/.
# Without this file every derived-image build ships the whole 187 MB tree —
# receipts, research, capsule data, and .git — to the daemon for nothing.
#
# Child recipes fetch their pinned artifact directly. The two package-managed
# tools additionally need their checked-in lock input, so only those exact
# files are admitted from tools/.
*
!src
!harness
!tools
!tools/s3p
!tools/s3p/build
!tools/s3p/build/package.json
!tools/s3p/build/package-lock.json
!tools/s4cmd
!tools/s4cmd/build
!tools/s4cmd/build/requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
